==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|is|non|lítill}}, from {{der|is|gem-pro|*lītilaz}}. Cognate with {{cog|fo|lítil}}, {{cog|da|liden}}, {{cog|no|liten}}, {{cog|sv|liten}}, {{cog|ovd|litn}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|is|/ˈliːtɪtl/}}
*: {{rhymes|is|iːtɪtl}}

===Adjective===
{{is-adj|@@}}

# [[short]], [[small]]
# [[little]], [[insignificant]]

